iginal_url":"https://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim/pull/771"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OwWWN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"30e392f4-b444-4484-95e2-06f8796d7e7f","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"キラーはあんまりないですねー（拡張含めて）\nまあ更新は活発ですね。Issueが増えすぎて少し押されてる感ありますけど","ts":"1620619058.103100","edited":{"user":"U7B4ZD49X","ts":"1620619068.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XhFT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73acfa37-8be5-4848-873a-b549f5f10de3","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"最近 telescope はキラー機能増えたりしたんだろうか。。。（流石にスレチ気味になってきてしまいました）","ts":"1620618924.101800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PLlx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd3c494f-9231-4c85-8a7b-c346e5c2542f","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"h連合軍（vim自然主義）vs y連合軍（VimIDE主義）","ts":"1620618691.100800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wPi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3217a62f-74da-415a-be7c-d3c5aa5b7e0b","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"通常バッファだとステータスラインが出てしまうので、個人的には 1 行バッファを floating-window にしたいなという気持ちがないこともないけどこれはただの好みですね。","ts":"1620618649.100200","thread_ts":"1620618649.100200","reply_count":13,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F5e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f52a1a01-7b5d-4e3e-9823-13ed0a20b30b","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"denite は input() ではなく編集専用の 1 行バッファを開く。という挙動なので candle よりもう少しリッチですね。","ts":"1620618601.099200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WG+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5200a2fe-f287-42fc-aba0-314ae543ec9e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"deniteとは結構違うんですか？","ts":"1620618521.098300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L9pf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6beacff6-1f14-4af1-b3bb-8d65a394e5f1","type":"message","user":"UJV04G927","text":"実はcandle使ってみたことがあります。\n多分この辺りの好みがhrsh7thさんと同じなので、非常にいい感じでした","ts":"1620618473.098100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"nandato","count":1,"users":["U8R597E9H"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pwh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1fda306f-c9b7-421d-8f7c-90af76a33311","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"この input() を 1 行 floating-window にするのが目標だったけど完全にやる気を失ってしまった。","ts":"1620618388.096700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"licB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c672b25c-8e08-4292-b578-de9d38f797d6","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"まあカーソル動かすとかはノーマルモードでやってもらって、絞り込みは `input()` でやってもらう。ってだけなんですけどね。","ts":"1620618358.096200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tDud"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8fdafa8-f760-4bde-bf93-2b34b7adae83","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"candle使ったことないから触った方がいいかもしれない","ts":"1620618247.095100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xxX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f57a42d3-4742-4cd7-a803-9235dfd8142d","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"絶対に使うべきではないけど、絞り込みと選択の UI は candle の方式が一番気に入ってるなあ。","ts":"1620618205.094200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WmDe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7cc52f5-619c-4174-9e3e-1c5ad3d9ca6e","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"許容できない制約が私を自作へと駆り立てる","ts":"1620618202.094100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ky6t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"445bb6c9-65f8-484d-a1e1-ef38d9fbe05a","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0",